{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/986742-where-are-the-void-creatures-from","id":986742,"title":"Where are the Void Creatures from?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Vampire: The Requiem"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-10-13T07:11:34-07:00","id":986742,"title":"Where are the Void Creatures from?","content":"Where do you think the Cruac Void Creatures from Cruac Style of the Void come from?<br /> <br /> Like do you think its from the same dimesion as the strix, or from the dark spaces between the stars?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2241-omegaphallic","name":"Omegaphallic","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-13T09:08:00-07:00","id":986794,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Omegaphallic</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/986742-where-are-the-void-creatures-from#post986742\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Like do you think its from the same dimesion as the strix, or from the dark spaces between the stars?</div> </div> </div> </div>There's a difference?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4854-justin-sane","name":"Justin Sane","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"319"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-13T09:50:08-07:00","id":986813,"title":"","content":"Well, I've never heard that strix were space aliens, so I guess there is. The strix's &quot;dimension&quot; is pretty unknown, frankly, it could be anything : Deep space, a specific place from the Abyss, maybe it's actually Arcadian outer space, or some weird inaccessible corner of the Hisil populated by mutated shadow spirits (far enough removed from regular spirits they aren't affected by the same powers) or maybe the part of Hisil that lies beyond the border of the known world. Maybe they're tied to the God Machine and their land is an aborted world. It may be neither of those things and something completely different.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7104-s-brechen","name":"S. Brechen","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"171"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-13T10:11:56-07:00","id":986823,"title":"","content":"I think where the Strix come from is classified by Mages as a Lower Depth, as it seems to be missing an defining element of the regular world. To Mages this manifests as the absence of certain Supernal Symbols.<br /> <br /> I think it's missing something close to, but not quite, the concept of Life. I can't remember exactly.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3326-an-fhuiseog","name":"An Fhuiseog","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3326_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"271"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-13T10:45:39-07:00","id":986843,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>An Fhuiseog</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/986742-where-are-the-void-creatures-from?p=986823#post986823\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I think where the Strix come from is classified by Mages as a Lower Depth, as it seems to be missing an defining element of the regular world. To Mages this manifests as the absence of certain Supernal Symbols.<br /> <br /> I think it's missing something close to, but not quite, the concept of Life. I can't remember exactly.</div> </div> </div> </div>Dave said that Strixworld lacks Vitae. What a Lower Depth is missing isn't always as broad a whole Arcanum.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://eoinsstuff.shoutwiki.com/wiki/Genius:_the_Transgression_(2nd_Edition)\" target=\"_blank\">Genius: the Transgression 2E is a thing that's being worked on.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4488-malonkey1","name":"malonkey1","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4488_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1620"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-13T16:05:05-07:00","id":986992,"title":"","content":"'Lower Depth' isn't particularly explanatory, and little more than just saying 'Other World.' The Inferno is a Lower Depth, as is the Empyrean, and almost everything that isn't the Fallen World or the Abyss.<br /> <br /> I imagine it will go into more detail in Secrets of the Covenants, a lot of the book will be 'first person' perspectives on things, including Cruac. I probably would associate Void Creatures as something from space. The Circle has been known to deal with things like that before, such as with their creation of the Edimmu.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-13T16:45:05-07:00","id":987007,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>malonkey1</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/986742-where-are-the-void-creatures-from?p=986843#post986843\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Dave said that Strixworld lacks Vitae. What a Lower Depth is missing isn't always as broad a whole Arcanum.</div> </div> </div> </div>Ah thanks!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3326-an-fhuiseog","name":"An Fhuiseog","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3326_2.jpeg","title":